    <name>BlockVars</name>
    <description>
        This extension offers vars useful when working with Protocols. Examples are:
        — VarDimension: allows specifying an integer dimension.
        — VarPoint: allows specifying an integer point.
        — VarRectangle: allows specifying a rectangle with integer coordinates and dimensions.

        Also, different blocks have been made available to use these variables:
        — Define Point
        — Define Dimension
        — Define Rectangle (by point and dimension)
        — Define Rectangle 2 (by 4-integer properties)
    </description>
